  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Lets a study coordinator load source conversations with reference Q&A, set up sender/receiver/validator accounts, assign each sender→translation→receiver→validator chain, watch progress, and export snapshots, while participants record, answer and validate in role-specific screens. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
